{"title": "Knott’s Scary Farm criticized for ‘wildly childish’ jab at YouTuber for bad review", "link": "https://www.themeparktribune.com/knotts-scary-farm-criticized-for-wildly-childish-jab-at-youtuber-for-bad-review/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://www.themeparktribune.com/knotts-scary-farm-criticized-for-wildly-childish-jab-at-youtuber-for-bad-review/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Knott’s Scary Farm criticized for ‘wildly childish’ jab at YouTuber for bad review\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themeparktribune.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Knotts-Scary-Farm-entry-plaza-scaled.jpg?fit=300%2C200&ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"300\" /></a><p>Theme parks don't usually publicize negative reviews about themselves or call their critics \"idiots,\" but Knott's Berry Farm did just that to promote one of its Halloween shows.  </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.themeparktribune.com/knotts-scary-farm-criticized-for-wildly-childish-jab-at-youtuber-for-bad-review/\">Knott’s Scary Farm criticized for ‘wildly childish’ jab at YouTuber for bad review</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.themeparktribune.com\">Theme Park Tribune</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-09-18T16:20:28+00:00", "source": "Theme Park Tribune", "category": "queue", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-10-04T14:37:29.561576+00:00"}
